TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Gördün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} mü? {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Bir fener!
Belediye deposunda gördüğümü
hatırladım ve arayınca {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
gerçekten buldum. Çadırda {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
kaldığın için tam sana göre
olur diye düşündüm!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Wenn du dich vor die Laterne stellst
und  drückst, sollte sie angehen!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Willst du's mal versuchen?

{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Super!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sie ist so alt, dass ich mir nicht
sicher war, ob sie noch funktioniert.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Aber sie leuchtet ja einwandfrei!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Oh, what else{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Well, if you face the
lantern and hold down  while using
...
it will move backward or forward{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
or rotate in any direction you like.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Please put it wherever you want!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, that's all from me this time!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sorry to barge in on you like this!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'll be taking my leave now!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Bien, pues eso es todo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Espero no haberte molestado.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Me vuelvo al trabajo. ¡Adiós!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, credo di averti detto tutto!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Scusa per il disturbo e per aver
parlato tanto.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}È meglio che vada!

EN:
